      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Legend\nblue   = process / I/O\nyellow = decision branch\nred    = error / quarantine exit\n\nNote: audit + export share the same\ndetector — anomalies surface as a\ndata_quality block in the v2 payload.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Legend\nblue   = process / I/O\nyellow = decision branch\nred    = error / quarantine exit\n\nNote: audit + export share the same\ndetector — anomalies surface as a\ndata_quality block in the v2 payload.",
